      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cover (make 6)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: magic ring, 4 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (8 dc). Rounds 3 to 5: increase to 18 dc. Rounds 6 to 9: dc even. Rounds 10 to 12: "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-egg"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to close. Insert egg at round 9 before fully closing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
